    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17695" root="زرق" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُرَيْقَآءُ</span></b>  [dim. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَرْقَآءُ</span> fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَزْرَقُ</span>] (tropical:)  A mess of
crumbled bread (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَرِيدَةٌ</span>) <i>dressed with milk and
olive oil:</i> (JK, Z, K:) likened, because of its
seasoning, to the eyes that are termed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُرْق</span> (Z,
TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also <i>A certain small beast, resembling
the cat.</i> (Lth, K.)

